# satpulsewb over a pty, token enabled, auto-connecting to the receiver replay.
# The scenario then unplugs the device (closes the pty master) and asserts the
# workbench keeps serving and reports the receiver disconnected.
-L
127.0.0.1:${SATPULSE_TEST_HTTP_PORT}
-t
-d
${SATPULSE_TEST_SERIAL}
-s
38400
